    <!-- Honesty & Feasibility Disclosure -->
    <string name="disclosure_title">How Recovery Works</string>
    <string name="disclosure_body">This app safely finds: 1) Items in the device Media Trash / Recycle Bin, 2) Hidden or orphaned photos &amp; videos in app caches and .nomedia folders, and 3) Device media files. Note: On modern encrypted Android storage, permanently purged or overwritten files cannot be recovered without root access.</string>

